t: normal; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;"><li dir="rtl" style="font-size: 15pt; list-style-type: decimal; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; text-wrap: nowrap;" aria-level="1"><p dir="rtl" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;" role="presentation"><span style="font-size: 15pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap: wrap;">חימום (15 דקות)</span><span style="font-size: 15pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap: wrap;"> – הכנת הגוף לאימון עם תרגילי חימום דינמיים.</span></p></li><li dir="rtl" style="font-size: 15pt; list-style-type: decimal; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; text-wrap: nowrap;" aria-level="1"><p dir="rtl" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;" role="presentation"><span style="font-size: 15pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap: wrap;">טכניקת ריצה (10 דקות)</span><span style="font-size: 15pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap: wrap;"> – שיפור סגנון הריצה להעלאת היעילות.</span></p></li><li dir="rtl" style="font-size: 15pt; list-style-type: decimal; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; text-wrap: nowrap;" aria-level="1"><p dir="rtl" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;" role="presentation"><span style="font-size: 15pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap: wrap;">האימון העיקרי (30-45 דקות)</span><span style="font-size: 15pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap: wrap;"> – אינטרוולים, עליות, פרטלק, ואימוני מדרגות בהתאם לרמת הכושר האישית.</span></p></li><li dir="rtl" style="font-size: 15pt; list-style-type: decimal; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; text-wrap: nowrap;" aria-level="1"><p dir="rtl" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;" role="presentation"><span style="font-size: 15pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap: wrap;">אימוני כוח (30-40 דקות)</span><span style="font-size: 15pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap: wrap;"> – תרגילי חיזוק כמו סקווטים, לאנצ'ים, תרגילים לפלג גוף עליון וליבת הבטן.</span></p></li><li dir="rtl" style="font-size: 15pt; list-style-type: decimal; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; text-wrap: nowrap;" aria-level="1"><p dir="rtl" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;" role="presentation"><span style="font-size: 15pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap: wrap;">סיום (תרגילי גמישות)</span><span style="font-size: 15pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap: wrap;"> – תרגילי חיזוק וגמישות למניעת פציעות ולהארכת השרירים</span></p></li></ol>"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"3e12730","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"<h3 dir="rtl" style="font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; line-height: 1.38; color: rgb(27, 25, 219); margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 15pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;">למה להצטרף לקבוצת הריצה שלנו?</span><span style="color: var( --e-global-color-primary ); font-family: var( --e-global-typography-primary-font-family ), sans-serif; font-size: var( --e-global-typography-primary-font-size ); font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-primary-font-weight );"></span></h3>"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"f122d4f","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<ul style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; padding-inline-start: 48px;">
